	<item>
		<title>TNA Thanksgiving Special not airing on AMC in the United States</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398040-tna-thanksgiving-special-not-airing-on-amc-in-the-united-states/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398040-tna-thanksgiving-special-not-airing-on-amc-in-the-united-states/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:35:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Thanksgiving Special]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398040</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>TNA has announced that its Thanksgiving Special episode of IMPACT will not broadcast on AMC in the United&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398040-tna-thanksgiving-special-not-airing-on-amc-in-the-united-states/">TNA Thanksgiving Special not airing on AMC in the United States</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA has announced that its Thanksgiving Special episode of IMPACT will not broadcast on AMC in the United States.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The cable network&#8217;s <a href="https://www.amc.com/schedule/?tz=ET&amp;from=2026-11-26&amp;bc=east">schedule</a> notes that the film <em>The Great Outdoors</em> will air during IMPACT&#8217;s usual time slot, as part of a movie marathon for the holiday.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The special holiday episode, featuring &#8220;never before seen matches,&#8221; will instead air on AMC+ in the United States, Sportsnet 360 in Canada, and TNA+ worldwide as normal.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">PROGRAMMING NOTE: Due to the Thanksgiving holiday, next week&#39;s Thanksgiving Special episode of <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/TNAiMPACT?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#TNAiMPACT</a> will not broadcast on <a href="https://x.com/AMC_TV?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@AMC_TV</a>, but will be available on <a href="https://x.com/AMCPlus?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@AMCPlus</a>. <br><br>The episode will broadcast on TNA+ worldwide and <a href="https://x.com/Sportsnet?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@Sportsnet</a> 360 in Canada as normal. <a href="https://t.co/gx1Bx6hHN2">pic.twitter.com/gx1Bx6hHN2</a></p>&mdash; TNA Wrestling (@ThisIsTNA) <a href="https://x.com/ThisIsTNA/status/2123853890688840048?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 20, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398040-tna-thanksgiving-special-not-airing-on-amc-in-the-united-states/">TNA Thanksgiving Special not airing on AMC in the United States</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398040-tna-thanksgiving-special-not-airing-on-amc-in-the-united-states/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
