					<description><![CDATA[<p>WrestleVotes on Fightful Radio has reported that there have been several encouraging developments regarding a featured film based&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398004-report-a-list-hollywood-creative-team-involved-with-movie-about-former-wwe-champion/">Report: &#8216;A-list Hollywood creative team&#8217; involved with movie about former WWE champion</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WrestleVotes on Fightful Radio has reported that there have been several encouraging developments regarding a featured film based on Nattie Neidhart&#8217;s book <em>The Last Hart Beating,</em> which looks at her personal journey.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The project is expected to involve a high-profile, A-list Hollywood creative team, with discussions currently taking place across multiple major film studios.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sources familiar with the situation indicate that the movie is expected to carry a significant production budget, suggesting that the project is being approached a a potentially major Hollywood release.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Neidhart, daughter of the late WWE Hall of Famer Jim &#8220;The Anvil&#8221; Neidhart, recently added to the intrigue by sharing photos of herself visiting Paramount on social media.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Despite the buzz being generated by the former WWE Women&#8217;s Champion&#8217;s visit, no official agreement has been announced.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Discussions are reportedly ongoing as the project continues to develop heading into 2027.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398004-report-a-list-hollywood-creative-team-involved-with-movie-about-former-wwe-champion/">Report: &#8216;A-list Hollywood creative team&#8217; involved with movie about former WWE champion</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
